title: Payers › Changes › A change arrives (policy watch)
route: /payers/cardinal?tab=changes
intro: How a payer's policy change reaches a person. In the product Sentinel watches each payer's policy and portal, compares versions, finds what affects open work and raises a change. In the demo three changes (Cardinal, Harborview and Evergreen) are already waiting when the demo starts; there is no button that creates a new one. Reset demo data brings them back.
dir: TD
---
ext px "Payer publishes new criteria or a portal form change\nCardinal: criteria version 2026.3, effective 10/15\nHarborview: new portal form, old one closes 10/31\nEvergreen: a reference number on phone notice, effective 10/22\n(demo: already seeded)"
agent sn "Sentinel watches the payer's policy and portal\nFetches, compares with the last version, keeps only parts\nthat touch this clinic's programs, notes what changed"
agent mp "Sentinel maps the impact on open work\nOnly this payer's unsent drafts count\nCardinal: I-2207. Harborview and Evergreen: none right now"
store pc "Change opened for the payer: 'waiting for a person'\nTitle, one sentence, effective date,\ndrafts affected, agents that will redraft"
group gS "Where a person sees it"
  process s1 "Sidebar 'Payers' badge counts it (3 at the start)"
  process s2 "Payer row in the list: ochre dot"
  process s3 "Header plan line ends 'change waiting'"
  process s4 "'Changes' tab badge shows 1"
  toast s5 "Bell notification from Sentinel, unread\n'Payer rule changed'\nCardinal updated its criteria (version 2026.3). 4 drafts are affected.\n(Harborview's and Evergreen's changes have the badge and dots but no notification)"
endgroup

start st1 "Click the bell, then the notification"
click cn "Click 'Payer rule changed'"
process mr "Notification marked read, panel closes\nOpens /payers/cardinal?tab=changes"
start st2 "Ask FLO: 'Why is Cardinal's approval rate down?'"
click cl "Click 'Open Payers, Cardinal, Changes'"
start st3 "Demo menu, suggested path\n'Payers: Cardinal, Changes'"
start st4 "Click 'Payers', pick the payer with an ochre dot,\nclick the 'Changes' tab"
screen ch "Changes tab\nOchre banner 'Criteria changed, version 2026.3'\n'Progress evidence must now include the remaining treatment goals.\nScribe can redraft the 1 draft that is not yet sent: I-2207.\nRequests already sent keep what they were sent with.'"
process rj "Production also allows rejecting or deferring a change.\nThe demo offers only Acknowledge, then Update"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Changes › Acknowledge a change"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › Changes › Read what changed"

px --> sn --> mp --> pc
pc -->|Shows up at once| s1 & s2 & s3 & s4 & s5
st1 --> cn --> mr --> ch
s5 -.-> st1
st2 --> cl --> ch
st3 --> ch
st4 --> ch
ch --> g1
ch -.-> g2
ch -.-> rj
